<view class="page">
  <view class="card" wx:if="{{round}}">
    <view class="row"><text class="title">成团确认</text><text class="state">{{round.state}}</text></view>
    <text class="muted">成员：{{round.memberCount}} 个账号</text>
    <text class="muted">确认截止：{{round.confirmBy}}</text>
    <checkbox-group bindchange="onConsentChange"><label><checkbox value="granted" />我单独同意在后续全部付款成功后，按政策 {{round.contactPolicyVersion}} 向本轮成员共享我的微信号。</label></checkbox-group>
    <button loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="accept">确认同行</button>
    <button class="decline" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="decline">拒绝并退出本轮</button>
  </view>
  <view class="card"><text class="muted">{{message}}</text></view>
  <view class="card warning"><text>平台仅收取每账号 0.99 元信息服务费；全部成员付款且已同意后才会公开微信号。平台不提供司机、车辆、叫车、车费或运输服务。</text></view>
</view>
